e_zh": "风之杖", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Cyclone Sweeps a target unit up into a cyclone, making them invulnerable for %cyclone_duration% seconds. Cyclone can be cast on yourself, enemy units or allied units. When cast on yourself, you can move the tornado at a speed of %tornado_speed%. Enemy units take %tooltip_drop_damage% magical damage upon landing. Dispel Type: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Cyclone can dispel some buffs and debuffs.", "When cast on yourself, the cyclone can be moved anywhere at a speed of 360.", "Cyclone duration is unaffected by status resistance."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Cyclone Sweeps a target unit up into a cyclone, making them invulnerable for %cyclone_duration% seconds. Cyclone can be cast on yourself, enemy units or allied units. When cast on yourself, you can move the tornado at a speed of %tornado_speed%. Enemy units take %tooltip_drop_damage% magical damage upon landing. Dispel Type: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Cyclone can dispel some buffs and debuffs.", "When cast on yourself, the cyclone can be moved anywhere at a speed of 360.", "Cyclone duration is unaffected by status resistance."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "bonus_movement_speed", "old": {"base": [30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "7192bf86dec42f32baf8", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "227f22d5b14136458ec0", "mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加弱驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被弱驱散的效果", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "8cca9099450dc1590c30", "mechanism": "cyclone_banish", "mechanism_zh": "吹风/放逐", "definition": "使目标短暂离开战场，期间无敌或不可被选取", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "dd0286eb2c38fdbd9260", "mechanism": "cyclone_banish", "mechanism_zh": "吹风/放逐", "definition": "使目标短暂离开战场，期间无敌或不可被选取", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "7a28c359d2021f13976a", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f8c1cd780e0eb7960f74", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "3fec86f5346b853dc305", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:wind_waker:self_mobility:item", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:wind_waker:terrain_walk:item", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "windrunner_focusfire", "name_zh": "风行者·集中火力", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Windranger channels the wind to gain %bonus_attack_speed% additional attack speed against a single enemy unit or structure, though with a reduction to her attack damage. Extra damage from secondary item effects is not reduced.", "notes_loc": ["Issuing a Hold Position command will pause Windranger's attacks.", "Windranger can move while attacking."], "facets_loc": ["Focus Fire no longer requires a target, instead firing at random enemies within Windranger's attack range + %bonus_range%. Fires a fixed number of attacks per second, and can only hit the same enemy every 4 shots. Prioritizes Heroes."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Windranger channels the wind to gain %bonus_attack_speed% additional attack speed against a single enemy unit or structure, though with a reduction to her attack damage and her Item Potency.", "notes_loc": ["Issuing a Hold Position command will pause Windranger's attacks.", "Windranger can move while attacking."], "facets_loc": ["Focus Fire no longer requires a target, instead firing at random enemies within Windranger's attack range + %bonus_range%. Fires a fixed number of attacks per second, and can only hit the same enemy every 4 shots. Prioritizes Heroes."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "focusfire_attack_effectiveness", "old": null, "new": {"base": [75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "focusfire_damage_reduction", "old": {"base": [-25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [-18], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "d1f48f8f24dd59d9a57a", "mechanism": "attack_damage_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减攻击力", "definition": "降低目标的攻击力", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "ff58a1b29732e06cd2b8", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "windrunner_tailwind", "name_zh": "风行者·一路顺风", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Using an ability conjures a stacking Tailwind that gives Windranger a brief burst of movement speed. Movement speed bonus gradually starts fading halfway through the Tailwind duration. Passively increases Windranger's max movement speed.", "scepter_loc": "Attacks grant Tailwind. Tailwind lasts longer and is undispellable."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Using an ability conjures a stacking Tailwind that gives Windranger a brief burst of movement speed. Movement speed bonus gradually starts fading halfway through the Tailwind duration. Passively increases Windranger's max movement speed.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Break does not disable the bonuses from existing stacks."], "scepter_loc": "Attacks grant Tailwind. Tailwind lasts longer and is undispellable."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "982d94c571914df47a7b", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "28f996053643bbf7c004", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "winter_wyvern_arctic_burn", "name_zh": "寒冬飞龙·严寒烧灼", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Winter Wyvern soars upon an arctic wind, granting her unobstructed movement and allowing her to exhale a blistering chill into each attack. While soaring, her attacks travel further and faster, and slow enemies with a magical freeze that strips them of %percent_damage%%% of their current health each second.", "notes_loc": ["This ability does not affect Roshan.", "Reduces Winter Wyvern's attack point to %attack_point%.", "The damage and slow from Arctic Burn can be dispelled."], "scepter_loc": "Causes Arctic Burn to be a toggle ability, draining mana every second when active. Increases Winter Wyvern's movement speed."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Winter Wyvern soars upon an arctic wind, granting her unobstructed movement and allowing her to exhale a blistering chill into each attack. While soaring, her attacks travel further and faster, and slow enemies with a magical freeze that strips them of %percent_damage%%% of their current health each second.", "notes_loc": ["This ability does not affect Roshan.", "Reduces Winter Wyvern's attack point to %attack_point%.", "The damage and slow from Arctic Burn can be dispelled."], "scepter_loc": "Causes Arctic Burn to be a toggle ability, draining mana every second when active. Increases Winter Wyvern's movement speed."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "mana_costs", "old": [100], "new": [100, 105, 110, 115]}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [100, 105, 110, 115], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "45ae8b486ca195d97773", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:winter_wyvern_arctic_burn:attack_modifier:base", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "3208ccf3d7ada49e194c", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d44c396f24f5f7fcc2f8", "mechanism": "mana_burn", "mechanism_zh": "烧蓝/法力削减", "definition": "减少目标的法力值", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "6616a38fc45b7bd593b4", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "1a63a52b236745cd4aaa", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:winter_wyvern_arctic_burn:flying:base", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "winter_wyvern_cold_embrace", "name_zh": "寒冬飞龙·极寒之拥", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Encases an ally in an icy cocoon, freezing them solid while healing a base amount as well as a percentage of their maximum health each second. The cocoon blocks all physical damage.", "shard_loc": "Reduces cooldown by %shard_cooldown_reduction% seconds. Allied units gain bonus attack damage when emerging from the icy cocoon.", "facets_loc": ["Cold Embrace can be cast on buildings. Does not heal buildings. Allied units and buildings gain bonus attack damage when emerging from the icy cocoon. Duration is paused if the building is protected by both Glyph of Fortification and Cold Embrace."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Encases an ally in an icy cocoon, freezing them solid while healing a base amount as well as a percentage of their maximum health each second. The cocoon blocks all physical damage.", "shard_loc": "Reduces cooldown by %shard_cooldown_reduction% seconds. Allied units gain bonus attack damage when emerging from the icy cocoon.", "facets_loc": ["Cold Embrace can be cast on buildings. Does not heal buildings. Allied units and buildings gain bonus attack damage when emerging from the icy cocoon. Duration is paused if the building is protected by both Glyph of Fortification and Cold Embrace."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "heal_additive", "old": {"base": [40, 45, 50, 55], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [32, 40, 48, 56], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:winter_wyvern_cold_embrace:damage_block:base", "mechanism": "damage_block", "mechanism_zh": "护盾/伤害吸收/减伤", "definition": "吸收一定伤害、按比例减少受到的伤害，或把受到的伤害延迟结算（如统帅朗姆酒、虚妄之诺）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e334bb67db85cc0d0813", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "winter_wyvern_splinter_blast", "name_zh": "寒冬飞龙·碎裂冲击", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Launches a ball of brittle ice toward a unit. The ice shatters on impact, leaving the primary target completely unaffected, while hurling damaging splinters into nearby enemies in a %split_radius% base radius. Enemies struck by these splinters are slowed by %movespeed_slow_tooltip%%%.", "notes_loc": ["The primary projectile moves at %projectile_speed% movement speed.", "The primary projectile cannot be disjointed and cannot be targeted towards Winter Wyvern herself."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Launches a ball of brittle ice toward a unit. The ice shatters on impact, leaving the primary target completely unaffected, while hurling damaging splinters into nearby enemies in a %split_radius% base radius. Enemies struck by these splinters are slowed by %movespeed_slow_tooltip%%%.", "notes_loc": ["The primary projectile moves at %projectile_speed% movement speed.", "The primary projectile cannot be disjointed and cannot be targeted towards Winter Wyvern herself."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "b9acd7b3abe1898db676", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "adcefb692f703b4be676", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "829e966b46986c14a5f0", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "wisp_overcharge", "name_zh": "艾欧·过载", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Io gains attack speed, spell amplification, and health regeneration based on max health. If Io is Tethered to an ally, that unit also gains any bonuses granted by Overcharge.", "facets_loc": ["Overcharge grants attack speed and spell amplification to Io and any Tethered allies.", "Overcharge grants armor and magic resistance to Io and any Tethered allies."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Io gains attack speed, spell amplification, and health regeneration based on max health. If Io is Tethered to an ally, that unit also gains any bonuses granted by Overcharge.", "facets_loc": ["Overcharge grants attack speed and spell amplification to Io and any Tethered allies.", "Overcharge grants armor and magic resistance to Io and any Tethered allies."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "duration", "old": {"base": [8], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [7], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_